\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The overview of \textit  {MMoH}. \textit  {MMoH} comprises two key components: \textit  {MMoH parallel strategy planner} and \textit  {early-termination scheduler}. The MMoH planner takes the MLLM configuration and heterogeneous cluster specifications as input and determines the optimal parallel strategy. The scheduler leverages the characteristics of the frozen technique to further improve performance by reducing unnecessary computation and communication overhead.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
